+---
+id: task-003-reject-invalid-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Reject invalid task input"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Reject invalid input when a task is added, renamed or tagged, with an `invalid-input` error saying what is wrong:
+empty or blank title, title over 120 characters, priority other than low/normal/high, empty tag or tag with a space.
+A rejected call changes nothing in the list.
+
+Done: validators in `src/domain/task.ts`, applied in `src/domain/list.ts`; new error code `invalid-input`; tests in
+`test/list.test.ts`.
